-ㄴ달 -ㄴ달 [-ㄴdal] /-ndal — An expression used to assume that someone will do a certain act or make a certain statement, which modifies the following statement./
-ㄴ담 -ㄴ담 [-ㄴdam] /-ndam — (formal, highly addressee-lowering) A sentence-final ending used when asking oneself or complaining about a certain fact./
