-는 사이 -는 사이 [-neun sai] /-neun sai — An expression used to indicate a certain, short time in the middle of an act or situation./
-는 수가 있다 -는 수가 있다 [-neun suga issda] /-neun suga itda — An expression used to indicate that there is a slight possibility of the incident mentioned in the preceding statement occurring./
