-라나 -라나 [-rana] /-rana — A sentence-final ending used to convey someone's remark, and imply that the speaker has a slight doubt or no interest in it./-rana — A sentence-final ending used to convey someone's remark, and imply that it is displeasing or annoying./-rana — A sentence-final ending used to say something without certainty and in an indifferent attitude./
