-라는데 -라는데 [-raneunde] /-raneunde — An expression used to convey something heard or quote someone, adding the speaker's own thought or question./-raneunde — (informal addressee-lowering) An expression used to give the speaker's opinion indirectly, by conveying what the speaker heard./-raneunde — An expression used to convey someone's remark, such as an order, request, etc., and to continue the sentence./-raneunde — (informal addressee-lowering) An expression used to indirectly indicate the order or request the speaker heard./
