-라는데야 -라는데야 [-raneundeya] /-raneundeya — An expression used to indicate that, based on the opinion, etc., the speaker heard, the speaker had to say the following thing under the circumstances./-raneundeya — An expression used to indicate that, based on the order, recommendation, etc., the speaker heard, the speaker had to say the following thing under the circumstances./
