-우- -우- [-u-] /-u- — A suffix used to mean causation./
-원 -원 [-won] /-won — A suffix used to mean a person who is engaged in something./-won — A suffix used to mean a person who is involved in a group or organization./-won — A suffix used to mean a public institution or an organization./-won — A suffix used to mean a facility for caring and raising living things./
-위 -위 [-wi] /-wi — A suffix used to mean a committee./
