-율 -율 [-yul] /-yul — A suffix used to mean a rule./-yul — A suffix used to mean a ratio./
-으나 -으나 [-euna] /-euna — A connective ending used to indicate that the preceding content and the following content are different./-euna — A connective ending used when one's choice does not matter despite many options./
-으나 마나 -으나 마나 [-euna mana] /-euna mana — An expression used to indicate that whether a certain thing is done or not makes no difference./
-으나마 -으나마 [-eunama] /-eunama — A connective ending used when a certain situation is the condition for the following statement even though it is not satisfying./
