-으냐고요 -으냐고요 [-eunyagoyo] /-eunyagoyo — (informal addressee-raising) An expression used when asking a question that was already asked before./
-으냐기에 -으냐기에 [-eunyagie] /-eunyagie — An expression used to cite the question the speaker was asked as the reason or basis for the following statement./
