-으냐느니 -으냐느니 [-eunyaneuni] /-eunyaneuni — A connective ending used to ask this way or ask that way./
-으냐는 -으냐는 [-eunyaneun] /-eunyaneun — An expression used to quote a certain question, and modify the following statement./
