-으냐는군 -으냐는군 [-eunyaneungun] /-eunyaneun-gun — (formal, highly addressee-lowering) An expression used to convey the question of another person to the listener./
-으냐는데 -으냐는데 [-eunyaneunde] /-eunyaneunde — An expression used to quote the question the speaker was asked and add the speaker's own thoughts, questions, etc./-eunyaneunde — (informal addressee-lowering) An expression used to indirectly express what the speaker wants to say by conveying the question the speaker heard./
