-으리라 -으리라 [-eurira] /-eurira — (formal, highly addressee-lowering) A sentence-final ending used when the speaker guesses a certain situation./-eurira — (formal, highly addressee-lowering) A sentence-final ending used when the speaker makes a determination in his/her mind./
-으리라고 -으리라고 [-eurirago] /-eurirago — An expression used to convey one's intention./-eurirago — An expression used to convey one's guess./
-으리라는 -으리라는 [-euriraneun] /-euriraneun — An expression used to convey one's intention, modifying the following noun./-euriraneun — An expression used to convey one's guess, modifying the following noun./
