-자느냐 -자느냐 [-janeunya] /-janeunya — (formal, highly addressee-lowering) An expression used to ask the listener about the suggestion or recommendation the speaker heard from another person to cross-check the information./
-자느니 -자느니 [-janeuni] /-janeuni — A connective ending used to suggest doing this or doing that./
