개 잡듯 개 잡듯 [gae jabdeus] /like slaughtering a dog — The manner in which one hits and beats something to a pulp like when slaughtering a dog./
개 팔자가 상팔자 개 팔자가 상팔자 [gae paljaga sangpalja] /A dog's life is the best lot — An expression used to complain about one's hectic and tough life and show one's envy of a  dog's idle and nonchalant life./
개 패듯 개 패듯 [gae paedeus] /like bashing a dog — The manner in which one hits and beats something to a pulp like when slaughtering a dog./
