구체적 구체적 [guchejeog] /being concrete; being material — A state of being equipped with recognizable forms./being detailed; being specific — A state of being substantial and detailed./embodied — Having a shape so that people can see with their own eyes./concrete — Practical and detailed./
구체제 구체제 [gucheje] /old structure; old system — An organizational system and order of the past, far behind the times./
