길눈(이) 밝다 길눈(이) 밝다 [gilnun(i) balgda] /have a good sense of direction — To be good at remembering streets to which one has gone a couple of times before./
길눈(이) 어둡다 길눈(이) 어둡다 [gilnun(i) eodubda] /have a bad sense of direction — To be bad at remembering streets even if one has gone there before./
길다 길다 [gilda] /grow — For hair to grow./long; lengthy; extensive — Two ends of an object being far apart./long; prolonged; lengthy — The time from a certain moment to the next moment being long./wordy; lengthy — A piece of writing being long and containing lots of words./long lasting — A sound, sigh, etc. lasting long./
길동무 길동무 [gildongmu] /traveling companion; company — A friend to travel together with./
