꾸중하다 꾸중하다 [kkujunghada] /scold; rebuke — For an elder to point out a mistake or wrongdoing of a younger person./
꾸지람 꾸지람 [kkujiram] /scolding; admonition — The act of an elder pointing out a mistake or wrongdoing of a younger person./
