꾹꾹 꾹꾹 [kkugkkug] /firmly; hard — In the manner of pressing down, gripping, or tightening very strongly or repeatedly./patiently; stoically — In the manner of enduring or bearing very painfully or repeatedly./completely — In the manner of hiding or not entirely coming out of a place./
