꿀돼지 꿀돼지 [kkuldwaeji] /piggy — (children's term) A pig./
꿀떡 꿀떡 [kkultteog] /kkultteok; rice cake with honey filling — A kind of tteok, rice cake, with honey or sugar inside./gulp; at a gulp — A word imitating the sound or describing the motion of swallowing food, etc., through the throat at once./
