꿀물 꿀물 [kkulmul] /honey water; honey tea — Water with honey in it./
꿀밤 꿀밤 [kkulbam] /Dutch rub — Hitting someone's head lightly with a fist tip./
꿀벌 꿀벌 [kkulbeol] /honeybee — A bee with a dark brown body and transparent wings, which carries and gathers nectar from flowers./
꿀통 꿀통 [kkultong] /bee hive; honey barrel — A container where nectar or honey is stored by bees or people./
