꿈(을) 깨다 꿈(을) 깨다 [kkum(eul) kkaeda] /awake from a dream — To lower one's hope or give up frothy thinking./
꿈결 꿈결 [kkumgyeol] /being in one's sleep; being while dreaming — The time of dreaming in one's sleep./fleeting moment — The time span during which time passes very quickly./
꿈길 꿈길 [kkumgil] /route of one's dream — The process of something occurring in a dream./
꿈꾸다 꿈꾸다 [kkumkkuda] /dream — To be in a dreaming state./wish; hope — To hope that something will come true or set an aim in one's mind./
