꿈나라로 가다 꿈나라로 가다 [kkumnararo gada] /go to the dream land — To fall fast asleep./
꿈나무 꿈나무 [kkumnamu] /promising kid; prominent person — (figurative) A very talented child./
꿈도 꾸기 전에 해몽 꿈도 꾸기 전에 해몽 [kkumdo kkugi jeone haemong] /interpret a dream even before actually dreaming — To imagine and expect something as one likes even though no one can be sure how it will turn out./
