꿈에도 없다 꿈에도 없다 [kkumedo eobsda] /be not even in dreams — To have never given something a thought./
꿈인지 생시인지 꿈인지 생시인지 [kkuminji saengsiinji] /Is it a dream or reality? — An expression to describe one's perplexed and puzzled feeling when something completely unexpected happens./Is it a dream or reality? — An expression to describe one's feeling when something that one has been longing for comes true, but one still feels it is a dream, not a reality./
