꿈쩍(도) 안 하다[하지 않다] 꿈쩍(도) 안 하다[하지 않다] [kkumjjeog(do) an hada[haji anhda]] /not budge — To stand firm in one's view or will no matter what others say./
꿈쩍하다 꿈쩍하다 [kkumjjeoghada] /make a big move — For something that has been keeping still to make a sudden big movement; to make a sudden big movement of something that has been keeping still./
