끈적거리다 끈적거리다 [kkeunjeoggeorida] /be sticky; be glutinous — To keep sticking to something./desirous; craving — For desire to be felt in one's attitude or behavior towards the opposite sex./
끈적끈적 끈적끈적 [kkeunjeogkkeunjeog] /stickily — In the state of being gluey and sticking to something./stickily — In the manner of staring at something piercingly, to the point of the stare becoming uncomfortable./
끈적끈적하다 끈적끈적하다 [kkeunjeogkkeunjeoghada] /sticky — Gluey and sticking to something./close-knit — Having strong emotional bonds and intimate relations with each other./lewd — Showing an attitude or actions towards the other gender, which is lustful enough to be unpleasant./sticky — Staring at something piercingly, to the point of the stare becoming uncomfortable./
끈적대다 끈적대다 [kkeunjeogdaeda] /be sticky; be glutinous — To keep sticking to something./desirous; craving — For desire to be felt in one's attitude or behavior towards the opposite sex./
