끌어모으다 끌어모으다 [kkeuleomoeuda] /gather; bring together — To gather people in one place./raise — To get money from here and there and accumulate it./draw; attract — To gather attention./
끌어안다 끌어안다 [kkeuleoanda] /hug; embrace — To pull another person towards oneself and hug him/her./take responsibility — To have a problem that needs to be solved or take responsibility./embrace — To understand and embrace./
