낯빛 낯빛 [nachbich] /complexion; face color — The color or feelings shown on one's face./
낯설다 낯설다 [nachseolda] /unknown; unfamiliar; unacquainted — Having not previously encountered or seen someone, and thus not knowing him/her./unfamiliar; strange — Having not previously seen, heard of, or experienced something, and thus being not familiar with it./
