내갈기다 내갈기다 [naegalgida] /strike; hit; beat; slap — To badly hit or strike a person or an animal's body with a fist or a whip./scribble; scrawl — To write or draw something quickly and disorderly./shoot wildy; fire blindly — To continue to fire guns or cannons indiscriminately./urinate or defecate here and there — To urinate or defecate anywhere, usually in public./babble; gabble — To pour words or hurl insults./
내걸다 내걸다 [naegeolda] /hang — To hang something outside or in the front./risk; bet — To be prepared to risk one's life, reputation, etc./swear; lay down; specify — To pledge by one's name, or specify conditions or goals./
