냉소 냉소 [naengso] /cynical smile; sarcastic smile — The act of making a cold smile at someone, or the smile made in this manner./
냉소적 냉소적 [naengsojeog] /being cynical; being sarcastic — The state of having the attitude of showing a cold smile at someone./cynical; sardonic — Sneering at someone or something with a cold attitude./
