눈가루 눈가루 [nungaru] /snow flour — Grains of snowflakes./
눈가리개 눈가리개 [nungarigae] /blindfold; eyeshade — An object used to cover an eye or eyes, due to an eye disease or for sleep./
눈가림 눈가림 [nungarim] /hoodwinking; deceiving; temporizing measure — Deceiving the eyes by just working on the appearance./
눈가림하다 눈가림하다 [nungarimhada] /blind the eyes; hoodwink; cover up — To deceive the eyes by just working on the appearance./
눈감다 눈감다 [nungamda] /die — To breathe one's last breath./shut one's eyes; overlook — To pretend not to know even though one knows another person's mistake or wrongdoing./
