두 손뼉이 맞아야 소리가 난다 두 손뼉이 맞아야 소리가 난다 [du sonppyeogi majaya soriga nanda] /Two palms have to slap against each other to make sound — Whatever it is, both parties involved should be of one mind to make it happen./Two palms have to slap against each other to make sound — Both parties involved are to blame in every fight or conflict./
