따끈하다 따끈하다 [ttakkeunhada] /pretty hot — Feeling fairly warm and hot./
따끈히 따끈히 [ttakkeunhi] /warm; warmly — In such a manner that something is quite warm and hot./
따끔 따끔 [ttakkeum] /in an excruciatingly hot manner — A word describing a very hot, smarting feeling./in a stinging manner — A word describing a sharp feeling that stimulates one's heart./in a stinging manner — A word describing a hurtful feeling, like when one is poked or pinched./
