따끔따끔 따끔따끔 [ttakkeumttakkeum] /in an excruciatingly hot manner — A word describing a very hot, smarting feeling./in a stinging manner — A word describing a sharp feeling that stimulates one's heart./in a stinging manner — A word describing a hurtful feeling, like when one is poked or pinched./
