따뜻하다 따뜻하다 [ttatteushada] /warm — Being an appropriate, pleasant temperature, which is not too high./friendly — In a loving and comfortable state of mind, having such emotions or attitude, or being in such an atmosphere, etc./
따라 따라 [ttara] /ttara — A postpositional particle used to mean &quot;different from the usual for no particular reason.&quot;/
따라가다 따라가다 [ttaragada] /follow; go after — To follow someone or something ahead on the same track./equal; match — To reach a similar degree or level./go along; travel along — To go along a fixed road or in a fixed direction./imitate — To do exactly according to a method, someone's order, or form of behavior./
따라나서다 따라나서다 [ttaranaseoda] /go with; accompany; tag along — To leave for somewhere with someone./
따라다니다 따라다니다 [ttaradanida] /follow; shadow — To follow someone./linger; not disappear — For a certain feeling, thought, phenomenon, etc., to linger in one's mind, despite one's will./
