따라서 따라서 [ttaraseo] /therefore; so; hence — An adverb used when a statement is the reason for, grounds for, or condition of the following statement./
따라서다 따라서다 [ttaraseoda] /catch up with — To follow someone or something from behind and keep up with him/her/it./equal; match — To reach the same level from the previous state of falling behind./
따라오다 따라오다 [ttaraoda] /follow — To trace someone or something that moves exactly in the same route./equal; match — To be near the degree or level of someone or something ahead./imitate; follow — To do exactly according to someone's method, behavior, intention, etc./go along; travel along — To walk on a certain line, etc./happen together — For a certain incident to happen at the same time as another incident./
따라잡다 따라잡다 [ttarajabda] /catch up with — For someone or something behind to approach or excel someone or something ahead./
따라잡히다 따라잡히다 [ttarajabhida] /be caught up with — For something or someone ahead to become in the same line or level, as the following one catches up./
