따사롭다 따사롭다 [ttasarobda] /pretty warm — Having some warmth./warm — Having a kind heart./
따스하다 따스하다 [ttaseuhada] /warm — A weather or sunlight being pleasingly warm./warm; kind — A facial expression or state of mind being tender./
