딱 딱 [ttag] /with a snap — A word imitating the sound or describing the motion of a hard object breaking or hitting against another hard object./suddenly; all of a sudden — In the manner that an incessant noise, thought, or behavior suddenly stops or comes to a halt./resolutely; decisively; flatly; completely; once and for all — In a manner of one quitting something decisively or acting boldly./really — In a manner of one hating something./broad — In a state in which one's chest and shoulders are wide, or one's eyes and mouth are open wide./precisely — In the state of being correct in number, amount, size, situation, etc./all of a sudden — In the manner of meeting with someone or something suddenly./strongly — In the state of standing firmly without moving./firmly — In the state of adhering tightly to something./
