또랑또랑하다 또랑또랑하다 [ttorangttoranghada] /clear; distinct — A person's eyes, voice, spirit, etc., being very bright and clear./
또래 또래 [ttorae] /peer — A group of people of similar age or level, or a person in such a group./
또렷또렷하다 또렷또렷하다 [ttoryeosttoryeoshada] /very clear — Very clear and sure./
또렷이 또렷이 [ttoryeosi] /clearly — Clearly and surely./
또렷하다 또렷하다 [ttoryeoshada] /clear — Clear and sure./
