또르르 또르르 [ttoreureu] /into a roll — A word describing the movement of a thin, narrow object rolling up fast and powerfully./rolling; with a rolling sound — A word imitating the sound or describing the movement of a small, round thing rolling lightly./
또박또박 또박또박 [ttobagttobag] /neatly; clearly — In the manner that a remark or handwriting, etc., are clear and distinct./regularly; punctually — In the manner of following a rule, order, etc., without violating it./with clear footsteps — A word imitating the sound or describing the movement of walking with the sound of footsteps clearly audible./
또박또박하다 또박또박하다 [ttobagttobaghada] /make clear footsteps — For the sound of walking with clearly audible footsteps to be heard./exact; accurate — A person's words, handwriting, etc., being clear and neat./
또한 또한 [ttohan] /also; as well — Likewise./additionally; and — In addition to that./
똑 똑 [ttog] /dripping — A word imitating the sound or describing the movement of a small object, waterdrop, etc., falling./with a snap — A word imitating the sound or describing the motion of a small, hard object being broken or cut./with a tap — A word imitating the sound of tapping at a hard object lightly./in the manner of snapping something off — In the manner of picking or nipping something off something else it is clinging or attached to, without hesitation./all of a sudden — In such a manner that something stops abruptly, without warning./decisively — In the manner of speaking or behaving firmly and definitely./completely — In the state of having absolutely nothing after spending all./certainly; surely; exactly — Exactly right in every way./
똑같다 똑같다 [ttoggatda] /exactly the same; equivalent to — Not a bit different from each other in shape, amount, quality, etc./just alike; identical — For two or more people being very similar to each other in appearance, attitude, behavior, etc./same — Having nothing new or special./
똑같이 똑같이 [ttoggati] /equally; evenly — In such a manner that two or more things are not a bit different from each other in shape, amount, quality, etc./identically — In a state in which two or more people are very similar to each other in appearance, attitude, behavior, etc./same — Without anything new or special./simultaneously — At the same time, or at the almost same time./
똑딱 똑딱 [ttogttag] /click — A word imitating the sound made when tapping a hard object lightly./tick-tock — A word imitating the sound made when a clock, motor, etc., is operated./
