똑똑 똑똑 [ttogttog] /drop by drop — A word imitating the sound or describing the movement of a small object, waterdrop, etc., falling repeatedly./with snaps — A word imitating the sound or describing the motion of a small, hard object being broken or cut repeatedly./with taps — A word imitating the sound of tapping a hard object lightly and repeatedly./in the manner of snapping something off — In the manner of picking or nipping something off something else it is clinging or attached to, without hesitation and repeatedly./
