똥 묻은 개가 겨 묻은 개 나무란다 똥 묻은 개가 겨 묻은 개 나무란다 [ttong mudeun gaega gyeo mudeun gae namuranda] /A dog with dung rebukes a dog with husks of grain — For one with greater faults or defects to speak ill of someone with smaller faults./
