문헌학 문헌학 [munheonhag] /philology — An academic area that studies the culture of an ethnic group or an era through documents./
문형 문형 [munhyeong] /sentence pattern — The pattern of a sentence classified according to its structure, type, function, etc./
문호 문호 [munho] /great writer; distinguished writer — A person who is well-known for having written outstanding literary works./door — A door through which one enters and exits a house./door; gate — (figurative) A passage or way to interact with the outside./
문화 문화 [munhwa] /culture — The physical and mental activities made, learned, shared, and delivered by a social community in order to realize a certain goal or ideal life./
