문화사 문화사 [munhwasa] /cultural history — The history and development process of culture; an academic area that studies such things./
문화생활 문화생활 [munhwasaenghwal] /cultural life — A life of doing or enjoying activities related to culture./
문화어 문화어 [munhwaeo] /Culture Language — The standard language of North Korea./
문화용품 문화용품 [munhwayongpum] /cultural goods — Various articles needed to satisfy cultural needs./
문화원 문화원 [munhwawon] /cultural center — A place designed by a society or organization to allow others to access its culture easily or to enjoy a variety of cultural life./cultural center — A place created by an embassy to allow others to access to and learn the country's culture and language./
