묻어가다 묻어가다 [mudeogada] /go along — To go along with another person or group./
묻어나다 묻어나다 [mudeonada] /be stained with; be smeared with — For substance painted or applied on a certain object to be touched by another object, which becomes stained./show; imply; indicate — For a certain atmosphere, emotion, etc., to be revealed in a speech, a piece of writing, etc./
묻어두다 묻어두다 [mudeoduda] /hide; conceal — To hide something without showing it./
묻어오다 묻어오다 [mudeooda] /come along — To come along with another person or group./
