바늘꽂이 바늘꽂이 [baneulkkoji] /pincushion — An object into which needles are stuck when not in use./
바늘대 바늘대 [baneuldae] /needle for mat weaving — A thin, long stick with grooves from which a thread of rush or straw is hung, used for weaving a mat or straw bag./needle bar — A bar for inserting a needle into a sewing machine./
