바라다보다 바라다보다 [baradaboda] /look at; stare at; gaze at — To look at someone directly in the face./
바라보다 바라보다 [baraboda] /look; stare; gaze — To look straight at something./watch — To examine and observe a certain event or phenomenon./expect; hope — To have expectation or hope for something./approach; come near — To approach a certain age./watch; leave alone — To watch something without interfering or meddling in it./regard; consider — To regard something as a particular thing./
