바싹 바싹 [bassag] /completely — A word describing something being dried or shrunk until little moisture is left./closely; tightly — A word describing someone or something being clung to or approaching another thing or person very closely./drastically — A word describing something increasing or decreasing suddenly./stubbornly — A word describing one insisting something very hard./stiffly — A word describing one being very nervous or tense./thinly — A word describing one being very thin./right away — A word describing one finishing something quickly at once./
