반짝 반짝 [banjjag] /in a flash — A word describing a small light appearing shortly and soon disappearing./soberly — A word describing one pulling oneself together instantly./suddenly — A word describing a thought suddenly striking one's mind./like a flash — A word describing an object, person, incident, etc., appearing shortly and soon disappearing./interestingly — A word describing a certain remark suddenly catching one's attention./clearly — A word describing something being clearly seen instantly./without a wink — A word describing one staying up, not sleeping./easily; effortlessly — In the manner of lifting something without difficulty./aloft — In the manner that the edge of something is suddenly lifted very high./high and lightly — In the manner of lifting a part of one's body lightly and suddenly./all of a sudden — In the manner of suddenly opening one's eyes wide./
