반짝반짝하다 반짝반짝하다 [banjjagbanjjaghada] /twinkle; glitter; shine — For a series of small lights to keep appearing briefly and disappearing; or to make this happen./glittery — Small lights flicking on and off./brilliant; clever — Quick-witted and coming up with novel ideas on the spur of the moment./
