방편 방편 [bangpyeon] /means; measures; plan — A way or method that enables one to handle a certain matter more easily case-by-case according to circumstances./
방풍 방풍 [bangpung] /protection against wind — An act of shielding against wind./
방풍림 방풍림 [bangpungrim] /shelterbelt; windbreak — A cluster of trees or shrubs planted to protect farmland, ranches, houses, etc. from strong wind./
