방한하다 방한하다 [banghanhada] /visit Korea — To visit Korea./
방한화 방한화 [banghanhwa] /winter shoes; arctic shoes — Shoes that a person wears to protect himself/herself from cold./
방해 방해 [banghae] /distraction; getting in one's way; disturbance — The act of interfering and hindering work from being done properly./
