방해꾼 방해꾼 [banghaekkun] /heckler; disrupter — (disparaging) A person who interferes and obstructs to make things not go well./
방해되다 방해되다 [banghaedoeda] /be interrupted; be disturbed — To be interrrupted and prevented from succeeding./
