방호벽 방호벽 [banghobyeog] /protective wall; protective barrier — A thick, wall-like partition installed to provide protection against external attack, explosion, etc./guardrail; safety rail — A railing installed on the bridge, etc. to prevent vehicles from running off a road./
방호복 방호복 [banghobog] /protective clothing — A special garment that a person wears to protect himself/herself from contamination caused by radiation or damages due to explosion or flame./
