방화 방화 [banghwa] /fire prevention — An act of preventing a fire before it happens./arson — The act of setting fire intentionally./
방화범 방화범 [banghwabeom] /arsonist — A person who intentionally sets fire to something./
방화벽 방화벽 [banghwabyeog] /firewall — A wall made of non-inflammable material built at the boundary or inside of a building to keep fire from spreading./firewall — A security system that prevents a computer from being attacked by an outside force through the Internet./
