번쩍 번쩍 [beonjjeog] /in a sparkle — A word describing a big light appearing shortly and soon disappearing./(no equivalent expression) — A word describing one pulling oneself together instantly./(no equivalent expression) — A word describing a thought suddenly coming to one's mind./(no equivalent expression) — A word describing an object, person, incident, etc., appearing shortly and soon disappearing./interestingly — A word describing a certain remark suddenly catching one's attention./(no equivalent expression) — A word describing something being clearly seen instantly./easily; without effort — In the manner of lifting something heavy very lightly and easily./aloft — In the manner that the edge of something is suddenly lifted very high./high and lightly — In the manner of lifting a part of one's body lightly and suddenly./all of a sudden — In the manner of suddenly opening one's eyes wide./
