번쩍이다 번쩍이다 [beonjjeogida] /sparkle — For a big light to appear and disappear for a short time, or to make this happen./
번쩍하다 번쩍하다 [beonjjeoghada] /become sober — For one's mind to suddenly become very clear./hit — For a thought to suddenly come to one's mind./disappear soon — For an object, person, incident, etc., to appear shortly and soon disappear./be heard — For a certain remark to suddenly catch one's attention./be seen — For something to be seen clearly for an instant./sparkle — For a big light to appear and disappear for a short time, or to make this happen./
