변제하다 변제하다 [byeonjehada] /repay; pay off; liquidate — To pay one's debt./
변조 변조 [byeonjo] /change; modification — The act of mending an item that was already finished so that it is changed to another item or shape./falsification — The act of changing the shape or content of a document, check, money, etc., by a person with no authority./
