변조하다 변조하다 [byeonjohada] /change; modify — To mend an item that was already finished so that it is changed to another item or shape./falsify — In law, to change the shape or content of a document, check, money, etc., by a person with no authority./
변종 변종 [byeonjong] /variety; variant — A state in which a thing belongs to the same kind or type as another thing but appears with different shape or quality, etc.; or such a thing./mutant — Among organisms, a living thing belonging to the same genus as another yet having different shape or quality./
