변주곡 변주곡 [byeonjugog] /variations — Pieces of music created just by varying the melody, rhythm, chord, etc., based on a theme./
변죽 변죽 [byeonjug] /edge — The edges of a vessel, table, or drum-like object such as the janggu, a traditional Korean drum./
