변질하다 변질하다 [byeonjilhada] /deteriorate; degenerate — For the nature or property of an object to change./change; alter — For the characteristic of something to change./
변천 변천 [byeoncheon] /change; transition — Something being changed as time goes by./
변천되다 변천되다 [byeoncheondoeda] /change; transit — To come to change with the passage of time./
변천하다 변천하다 [byeoncheonhada] /change; transit — To change as time goes by./
