변태적 변태적 [byeontaejeog] /being perverted — Sexual behavior or mentality being abnormal./perverted — One's sexual behavior or mentality being abnormal./
변통 변통 [byeontong] /handling properly; coping adequately with — The act of handling something properly on a case-by-case basis according to the situation./borrowing — The act of borrowing necessary money or things in a timely manner./
