보도되다 보도되다 [bododoeda] /be reported — For new information to be conveyed to the public through mass media such as broadcasting or newspapers./
보도진 보도진 [bodojin] /press — A group of reporters or cameramen who report news on the spot./
보도하다 보도하다 [bodohada] /report — To convey new information to the public through mass media such as broadcasting or newspapers./
보드랍다 보드랍다 [bodeurabda] /soft; smooth — Silky, not rough or stiff, to the touch./soft; gentle — One's personality, attitude, disposition, etc., being kind and warm./fine — The powder of something being very small and soft./
