보라색 보라색 [borasaeg] /violet; purple — A mixed color of red and blue./
보란 듯이 보란 듯이 [boran deusi] /as if saying 'look at me' — In a proud and confident manner to make others jealous./
보람 보람 [boram] /fruit; benefit; effect — A good result or a feeling of satisfaction that one gets after doing something./worth — The value or meaning of something, which makes one think highly of it./
