보물단지 보물단지 [bomuldanji] /Hangari, pot, for treasure — A pot that holds treasure./treasure; jewel — (figurative) A person who is so precious as to be cherished by another; or a highly valuable thing./
보물섬 보물섬 [bomulseom] /treasure island — An island where treasure is buried./treasure island — (figurative) A place so rich in resources as to hold high economic value./
