보이다 보이다 [boida] /be viewed; be visible; be in sight — To come to know the presence or outward appearance of an object by looking at it./look; appear — To come to know the content or state of an object by observing it./be visible — For a certain result to come out./be considered; be deemed; be regarded — For something to be thought of or regarded as having a certain trait./show; reveal — To make someone know the presence or outward appearance of an object by looking at it. ./show; display — To make someone enjoy or appreciate something by looking at it./show — To make someone observe something to know its content or state./show; react; undergo — To make a person or thing suffer or experience or come to gain something./show; introduce; present — To make a person look at a thing or meet another person with a certain purpose./
