부리 부리 [buri] /beak; bill — A hard and sharp part of a bird's mouth./
부리나케 부리나케 [burinake] /in a hurry — Very hurriedly and in haste./
부리다 부리다 [burida] /work; handle — To make a person or animal work at one's beck and call./control; operate — To handle a machine, device, etc., at will./manipulate — To summon a ghost, demon, etc., and make it move as one wants./unload — To discharge a load from one's back or a vehicle./do; perform — To show a skill or reveal a certain attitude./persist; wield — To often show or reveal an undesirable act or personality./
