부부간 부부간 [bubugan] /being conjugal; being marital — A relationship between husband and wife./
부부애 부부애 [bubuae] /conjugal love — Love between a husband and wife./
부부지간 부부지간 [bubujigan] /husband and wife relationship — The relationship between a husband and wife./
