부사격 부사격 [busagyeog] /adverbial case — A grammatical case indicating that a substantive modifies a predicate in a sentence./
부사격 조사 부사격 조사 [busagyeog josa] /adverbial case marker — A postpositional particle attached to a substantive, which transforms the substantive into an adverb indicating a place, tool, qualification, cause, time, etc., in relation to the predicate./
부사관 부사관 [busagwan] /non-commissioned officer — The rank between commissioned officer and soldier, which includes the grades of staff sergeant, sergeant first class, master sergeant, and sergeant major./
