부상하다 부상하다 [busanghada] /be injured — To be wounded./float — To float on water or in the air./emerge — To become the center of attention or rise to a high position./
부서 부서 [buseo] /department; division — One of the business units into which a company, institution or organization is divided based on the characteristics of the business./
부서뜨리다 부서뜨리다 [buseotteurida] /shatter; smash — To break something into several pieces./break — To destroy and make something become useless./crush; break — To destroy one's hope, expectation, etc./
부서지다 부서지다 [buseojida] /be shattered — For something hard to break into small pieces./break — For waves or light to dash against something, spread out, and then be scattered./be broken; break down — For something that has a certain structure to be destroyed so much as to be useless./be broken; be shattered — For one's hope or expectation to be destroyed./
