불다 불다 [bulda] /blow — For a wind to form and move in a certain direction./sweep; spread; be all the rage; be popular — For a vogue, trend, change, etc., to take place and spread./blow — To use the mouth to blow or create wind./whistle — To put the lips close to each other and make a sound by exhaling between them./breathe out; let out; exhale — To let out a breath hard through the nose./blow; play — To put a wind instrument to the mouth and exhale to make a sound./tell; admit; let out; rat out — (slang) To say what one has been hiding./
