빈껍데기 빈껍데기 [binkkeobdegi] /empty shell — (figurative) Something that only looks good on the surface without any real substance./
빈농 빈농 [binnong] /poor farmer; poor farm family — A family or farmer of a poor rural community./
빈대 빈대 [bindae] /bedbug — A tiny, reddish-brown, harmful insect with a flat round body that feeds on human blood./
빈대 붙다 빈대 붙다 [bindae butda] /cling to someone like a bedbug — (slang) To sponge off others and gain benefit./
