빈대도 낯짝이 있다 빈대도 낯짝이 있다 [bindaedo nachjjagi issda] /Even a bedbug has a mug — An expression used to criticize a person who is very shameless./
빈대떡 빈대떡 [bindaetteog] /bindaetteok; mung bean pancake — A pancake made by grinding soaked mung beans, adding vegetables and meat and pan-fying it round and flat./
빈도 빈도 [bindo] /frequency — The number of times that the same thing or phenomenon occurs./
빈둥거리다 빈둥거리다 [bindunggeorida] /fool around; idle away — To idle and enjoy one's free time, instead of working./
빈둥대다 빈둥대다 [bindungdaeda] /fool around; idle away — To idle and enjoy one's free time, instead of working./
빈둥빈둥 빈둥빈둥 [bindungbindung] /lazily — A word describing one idling and goofing around instead of working./
빈둥빈둥하다 빈둥빈둥하다 [bindungbindunghada] /fool around; idle away — To idle and enjoy one's free time, instead of working./
