빈소 빈소 [binso] /funeral home; funeral parlor; mortuary — A place within a funeral home or a house in mourning where a coffin is kept before the burial or cremation of the dead./
빈속 빈속 [binsog] /empty stomach — A stomach that is empty due to an insufficient intake of food such as rice, etc./
빈손 빈손 [binson] /empty hand — A hand with nothing in it./scratch; empty hand — (figurative) The state of not possessing anything./
