빈익빈 빈익빈 [binigbin] /the poor get poorer — A state in which poor people become poorer./
빈자리 빈자리 [binjari] /empty seat — A vacant place which is not occupied by anybody./empty post — A position in a group or organization left vacant after the previous person holding that position has left./
