빗- 빗- [bis-] /bit- — A prefix used to mean slanted./bit- — A prefix used to mean &quot;not doing something properly.&quot;/bit- — A prefix used to mean slantwise./
빗금 빗금 [bisgeum] /oblique line; diagonal line — A line that is drawn slantingly./
빗기다 빗기다 [bisgida] /have someone to comb — To get someone to arrange hair, fur, etc., with a comb, hand, etc./comb — To arrange hair, fur, etc., with a comb, hand, etc./
빗길 빗길 [bisgil] /rainy road — A road that is covered with rainwater or where the rain falls./
