뻐꾸기 뻐꾸기 [ppeokkugi] /cuckoo — A grayish blue-colored bird that lays its eggs in the other bird's nest./
뻐꾹 뻐꾹 [ppeokkug] /cuckoo — A word imitating the sound of a cuckoo./
