뻔지르르하다 뻔지르르하다 [ppeonjireureuhada] /slippery; sleek — Shiny and smooth as a result of oil or water on the surface./deceptive; showy; slick — A remark, behavior, object, etc., just looking good on the surface but being without substance./
뻔질나다 뻔질나다 [ppeonjilnada] /frequent — Frequent in coming and going, or making contact./
