뽀송뽀송하다 뽀송뽀송하다 [pposongpposonghada] /dry — Soft and having no moisture after being dried out./soft — One's skin or face being beautiful and smooth./fluffy — Having very short and soft hair or something similar to that./
뽀얗다 뽀얗다 [ppoyahda] /murky; foggy — Not clear and slightly white as if there were smoke or mist./pale; pearly — One's skin or complexion being fair and white./milky — A color being attractively white./
