뿌리다 뿌리다 [ppurida] /fall; blow and fall — For snow, rain, etc., to blow and fall, or cause them to fall./throw; spray; douse — To cause something to disperse and fall by throwing or pouring it./spread; waste; squander — To spend money recklessly without any thought of frugality./spread; disseminate; disperse — To spread a thought or influence widely./cry hard — To shed a lot of tears./spread; disseminate — To cause a bad rumor to be on everyone's lips./spread; disperse — To project light to be dispersed./scatter plant — To scatter plant seeds./be the reason; be the one who causes — To cause something to happen./
