사교육비 사교육비 [sagyoyugbi] /cost of private education; private tutoring expenses — A sum of money spent on getting private lessons, going to private institutes or cram schools, etc. excluding public education expenses./
사교장 사교장 [sagyojang] /place for social gathering; social club; salon — A place where many people gather, and associate and interact with one another./
사교적 사교적 [sagyojeog] /being sociable; being outgoing — A knack for easily associating with and mixing with many people./sociable; outgoing — Easily associating with and mixing with many people./
사군자 사군자 [sagunja] /sagunja — A painting of the plum, orchid, chrysanthemum and bamboo in Oriental painting./
사귀다 사귀다 [sagwida] /get along with; go around with; go out with — To come to know and keep each other's company./
