사기죄 사기죄 [sagijoe] /fraud; fraud charge — A crime of doing damage to others by deceiving them in the pursuit of one's own interest./
사나워지다 사나워지다 [sanawojida] /become violent — For one's personality or behavior to become wild./become fierce; become ferocious — For one's appearance to become scary and rough./become furious; become wild — For snow, rain, wind, etc., to become very severe./get fierce — For a situation or circumstances to become worse./
사나이 사나이 [sanai] /man — A vigorous and virile male at the peak of his manhood./
사나흘 사나흘 [sanaheul] /three or four days — A period of three or four days./
