사내애 사내애 [sanaeae] /boy; lad — (affectionate) An abbreviated word for a young male child./
사냥 사냥 [sanyang] /hunting — The act of a person going to a mountain or field and catching an animal using a gun, arrow, etc./preying on — The act of a strong animal catching a weaker animal to eat./
