사냥개 사냥개 [sanyanggae] /hound; hunting dog — A dog trained to use for hunting./
사냥꾼 사냥꾼 [sanyangkkun] /huntsman; hunter — A person who hunts or whose occupation is to hunt./
사냥터 사냥터 [sanyangteo] /hunting ground; hunting field; shooting preserve — A place for hunting./
