사념 사념 [sanyeom] /thought; consideration; worries — An array of thoughts that one comes across./
사다 사다 [sada] /buy; purchase; get — To get ownership of an item, right, etc., by paying for it./appreciate; admire; value — To recognize the value of a person or work./hire; retain — To pay someone to get help from him/her./cause; stir — To cause someone to develop certain feelings./buy; treat — To pay for someone's food after you both ate together./
