사대 사대 [sadae] /college of education — An abbreviated word for the college of education./
사대문 사대문 [sadaemun] /sadaemun — four main gates of old Seoul: The four main gates of Seoul in the Joseon Dynasty./
사대부 사대부 [sadaebu] /sadaebu — high-ranking government official: (archaic) A class of highly educated government officials who rule commoners; or a person from such a family./
