사돈댁 사돈댁 [sadondaeg] /son-in-law's parents; daughter-in-law's parents — (honorific) One's son-in-law's parents or daughter-in-law's parents./daughter's mother-in-law; daughter-in-law's mother — One's daughter's mother-in-law or daughter-in-law's mother./
