산간벽지 산간벽지 [sanganbyeogji] /remote mountain area; backwoods; isolated mountainous area — A secluded, mountainous area remote from a city./
산고 산고 [sango] /labor pain; birth pangs — The pain that one suffers when she gives birth to a baby./
산골 산골 [sangol] /backwoods; remote mountain area — A secluded, mountainous area./mountain valley; ravine — A hollow area between mountains./
