산꼭대기 산꼭대기 [sankkogdaegi] /mountaintop; peak; summit of mountain — A top of a mountain./
산나물 산나물 [sannamul] /wild greens; mountain greens; mountain herbs — A variety of wild greens that grow on the mountain./
산더미 산더미 [sandeomi] /pile; heap; stack — (figurative) A thing piled up in great numbers./pile; mountain; stack — (figurative) A great volume of work./
산동네 산동네 [sandongne] /hillside village; hillside neighborhood — A village or neighborhood located on a lower ridge or a hillside, normally populated with poor people./
산들바람 산들바람 [sandeulbaram] /breeze; gentle wind — A cool and soft wind./
산들산들 산들산들 [sandeulsandeul] /softly — A word describing the movement of the refreshing wind blowing gently./softly — A word describing the movement of something being swayed lightly and gently by the wind./
