살살 살살 [salsal] /gently — In the manner of water, etc., boiling slowly and evenly./comfortably — In the manner of the floor being evenly warm./quietly — In the manner of a small insect, etc., crawling without making noise./gently — In the manner in which one moves something or does something carefully./gently — In the manner of lightly shaking one's head, tail, etc. left and right./stealthily — In the manner of acting slowly and quietly so that others do not know./imperceptibly; softly — In the manner of snow, sugar, etc., melting away before one knows./softly; gently — In the manner of touching or rubbing something tenderly./adroitly; gently — In the manner of persuading someone indirectly so that one's intention is not revealed./gently — A word describing the wind blowing lightly and softly./gently — In the manner of smiling with one's eyes lightly./smoothly — In the manner of tangled thread, etc., disentangling easily./a little; to a slight degree — In a state in which one feels a slight pain in the stomach./
