선생 선생 [seonsaeng] /teacher; instructor — A person whose job it is to teach./professional — (polite form) A person who excels in a certain field of study or has excellent skills./professional; master — (figurative) A person who has rich experience in or knows well about something./Mr.; Mrs.; Doctor — (polite form) A word coming after one's last name or title, etc./
