선수 선수 [seonsu] /lead — An action taken ahead of others./lead — The act of placing a stone or piece first in the game of go or janggi, Korean chess, or placing it at an advantagious spot before one's opponent does./athlete; player; representative player — A person chosen as a representative in a sports game, or a person whose job is to play a sports game./master; expert — (figurative) A person who does a certain thing very well or frequently./
