손해나다 손해나다 [sonhaenada] /be damaged — To lose money, property, etc., or become mentally damaged./
손해되다 손해되다 [sonhaedoeda] /be damaged — To lose money, property, etc., or become mentally damaged./be harmed — To do harm./
