솔솔 솔솔 [solsol] /smoothly — A word describing water, powder, etc., coming through a crack or hole little by little./gently — A word describing the wind blowing softly./lightly — A word describing a fine rain or snow falling lightly./fluently; smoothly — In the manner of speaking or writing without hesitation./smoothly — A word describing a tangled or bound thread or string disentangling easily./easily — In the state of a knotty or difficult problem being solved easily./lightly — In the state of a smell or smoke rising lightly./quietly — In the state of feeling interested quietly./slowly; quietly — In the state of falling asleep slowly./
