순하다 순하다 [sunhada] /meek; mild; docile — One's personality, attitude, etc., being gentle and good./mild; gentle — The energy, nature, etc., of something being soft, neither wild nor strong./mild; light; gentle — Smooth, not strong./smooth — Easy, not difficult./
순항 순항 [sunhang] /cruising — A state in which a ship, airplane, etc., cruises smoothly towards its destination without any problems./cruising — A state in which a ship, airplane, etc., cruises smoothly in the direction of the wind, tidal current, etc./going smoothly — (figurative) A state in which a task, situation, etc., progresses favorably./
