순화 순화 [sunhwa] /purification — The act of making someone or something pure by eliminating impurities./simplification — The act of making a complicated thing simple./purification — The act of causing someone to change his/her thoughts or feelings in a desirable manner by teaching him/her./
순화되다 순화되다 [sunhwadoeda] /be purified — To become pure, free from impurities./be simplified — For a complicated thing to become simple./be purified — For one's thoughts or feelings to be changed in a desirable manner through teachings./
순화하다 순화하다 [sunhwahada] /purify — To make someone or something pure by eliminating impurities./simplify — To make a complicated thing simple./purify — To cause someone to change his/her thoughts or feelings in a desirable manner by teaching him/her./
