쓸어내리다 쓸어내리다 [sseuleonaerida] /smooth down; stroke — To touch something in a sweeping motion downwards./feel relieved — To feel at ease because a tough or difficult matter, worry, concern, etc., has been solved./
쓸어버리다 쓸어버리다 [sseuleobeorida] /sweep; wipe out — To eliminate something completely./
쓸어안다 쓸어안다 [sseuleoanda] /hug — To embrace something or someone tightly./
