씁쓸하다 씁쓸하다 [sseubsseulhada] /bitterish — Tasting a little bitter./bitterish; a bit bitter — Feeling a little displeased or disgusted./
씁쓸히 씁쓸히 [sseubsseulhi] /bitterly — With an unpleasant or bad feeling./
씌다 씌다 [ssuida] /be possessed — To come into contact with a ghost, etc./
