씨근씨근하다 씨근씨근하다 [ssigeunssigeunhada] /wheeze; breathe hard; pant — For the sound of breathing irregularly, roughly, and hard, to be heard; to make such a sound./breathe calmly — For a child to breathe very quietly while sleeping./
