아득하다 아득하다 [adeughada] /remote; faraway — Something that is seen or heard being vague and feeling far-off./remote; far-off — One’s memory being so old as to be dim./hazy; being in a haze; dazed — One’s consciousness being dim./dim — Feeling confused and anxious because one does not know what to do./
아들 아들 [adeul] /son — One's male child./
