어쨌든 어쨌든 [eojjaessdeun] /anyway; anyhow; at any rate — Regardless of what happened, or how something turned out./eojjaetdeun — An abbreviated word for '어찌하였든' (a conjugated form of '어찌하다')./
어쨌든지 어쨌든지 [eojjaessdeunji] /anyway; anyhow; at any rate — Regardless of what happened./eojjaetdeunji — An abbreviated word for '어찌하였든지' (a conjugated form of '어찌하다')./
어쩌고저쩌고 어쩌고저쩌고 [eojjeogojeojjeogo] /blah-blah-blah; yadda-yadda-yadda — (humorous) In a manner of going on and on with complaints./
어쩌고저쩌고하다 어쩌고저쩌고하다 [eojjeogojeojjeogohada] /grumble; talk nonsense — (humorous) To go on and on with complaints./
어쩌다 어쩌다 [eojjeoda] /do — To do something in a certain way./be a certain — The word meaning 'what,' 'whatever,' etc./accidentally; by chance — Incidentally to one's surprise./occasionally; now and then — Once in a while, or sometimes./eojjeoda — An abbreviated word for '어찌하다.'/
어쩌다가 어쩌다가 [eojjeodaga] /accidentally; by chance — Incidentally to one's surprise./occasionally; now and then — Once in a while, or sometimes./eojjeodaga — An abbreviated word for '어찌하다가' (a conjugated form of '어찌하다')./
어쩌면 어쩌면 [eojjeomyeon] /maybe; perhaps; possibly — Not sure but presumably./how; what — How on earth./why; oh my goodness — An exclamation used when arguing or exclaiming./eojjeomyeon — An abbreviated word for '어찌하면' (a conjugated form of '어찌하다' (somehow))./
어쩐지 어쩐지 [eojjeonji] /somehow — Even though one does not know the reason./
