어쩔 줄(을) 모르다 어쩔 줄(을) 모르다 [eojjeol jul(eul) moreuda] /not know what to do — To be at a loss as one does not know what to do./
어쩜 어쩜 [eojjeom] /maybe; perhaps; possibly — Not sure but presumably./how; what — How on earth, as if one cannot believe it./why; oh my goodness — An exclamation used when one is surprised at or admires an unexpected matter./
어쭙잖다 어쭙잖다 [eojjubjanhda] /ridiculous; laughable — One's words or behavior being a bit excessive enough to incur ridicule./worthless; trivial — Trifling and insignificant./
