어찌어찌 어찌어찌 [eojjieojji] /somehow; in some way — In this way and that./
어찌어찌하다 어찌어찌하다 [eojjieojjihada] /do somehow; do in some way — To manage to do something by this way and that./
어찌하다 어찌하다 [eojjihada] /show why — To express the reason for something./do something — To do something in a certain manner./
어찔하다 어찔하다 [eojjilhada] /dizzy; faint — Feeling hazy and giddy suddenly./
어차피 어차피 [eochapi] /in any case; after all — Regardless of whether something turns out like this or that; regardless of whether one does something in this way or that./
어처구니 어처구니 [eocheoguni] /being unspeakable; being staggering; being absurd — A person or thing that is big beyond one's imagination./
