얻다 얻다 [eodda] /get; receive — To take and have something without special efforts or without paying for it./get; secure; gain — To come to have or enjoy a positive attitude, response, state, etc./get; find — To seek or look for something and then have it./borrow — To get a loan./rent — To lease a house, room, etc./get; obtain; have — To secure or get a right, result, property, etc./employ; hire — To come to find and use a worker./take — To take someone into one's family./get; catch; develop — To become ill./
