얼결 얼결 [eolgyeol] /being momentarily dazed; moment of confusion — A state of being during the time when a person is out of his/her senses due to an unexpected or complicated event./
얼굴 얼굴 [eolgul] /face — The front part of the head that has the eyes, nose and mouth./face — The overall appearance or look of the front part of the head./face — One's reputation, honor, dignitiy and good name that is widely known to people around him/her./look on one's face — The look on one's face that represents the state of his/her mind./face — A figure that engages in a certain activity./face — Something that is representative of an object or well depicts its true nature./
얼굴값 얼굴값 [eolgulgabs] /behaving the way one looks — One's words and actions that befit the way one looks./
