엄숙히 엄숙히 [eomsughi] /solemnly; gravely; seriously — In a manner of a ceremony, atmosphere, etc., being heavy and quiet./solemnly; gravely; seriously — In a manner of a speech, attitude, etc., being heavy and refined./
