엄하다 엄하다 [eomhada] /stern; strict; rigorous — Thorough and upright in applying a rule or teaching manners./strict — Thoroughly cautious so that there is not any problem with something or someone's behavior./stern; strict; rigorous — One's personality or behavior being very thorough and fastidious./
