온정 온정 [onjeong] /warm heart — Warm love or generosity./
온조왕 온조왕 [onjowang] /Onjowang — King Onjo: The first king (?~28) of the Baekjae Kingdom. As the son of Jumong, the founder of the Goguryeo Kingdom, he came south and founded the Baekjae Kingdom./
