올록볼록 올록볼록 [olrogbolrog] /unevenly; bumpily — In a state in which the surface or bottom of something is not even and protrudes in places./
올리다 올리다 [olrida] /increase; raise — To make a price, figure, energy, etc., get higher or increase./achieve; improve; advance — To make a performance, achievement, etc., reach a high level./raise; lift; elevate — To make something move from a lower to a higher position./hold; observe — To hold a ceremony or ritual./present; give; offer — To hold a service or ceremony or offer a prayer./raise; give — To shout or shriek loudly./give — To give a slap on the cheek, etc./improve — To make something reach a certain level./lay; put — To make something laid on something else./serve — To put food on a table./bring — To have something as the topic of a conversation./enter; put — To register; to fill in./roof — To put tiles, etc., on a roof to complete the roof./build — To construct a building./upload — To upload a file, post, article, etc., on a computer network or Internet newspaper./offer; present — To greet, make a bow or speak to one's superior, or hand something to him/her./submit — To present a document, etc., to one's superior or a superior organization./
