이러다 이러다 [ireoda] /do this way — To do in this manner./say like this — To speak like this./
이러다가 이러다가 [ireodaga] /ireodaga — An abbreviated word for '이리하다가' (a conjugated form of '이리하다' (do in this way))./
이러면 이러면 [ireomyeon] /ireomyeon — An abbreviated word for '이리하면' (a conjugated form of '이리하다' (do in this way))./ireomyeon — An abbreviated word for '이러하면' (a conjugated form of '이러하다' (be like this))./
이러면서 이러면서 [ireomyeonseo] /ireomyeonseo — An abbreviated word for '이리하면서' (a conjugated form of '이리하다' (do in this way))./
