이러자 이러자 [ireoja] /ireoja — An abbreviated word for '이리하자' (a conjugated form of '이리하다' (do in this way))./
이러저러하다 이러저러하다 [ireojeoreohada] /being such and such — A term used when the speaker does not want to explain a certain fact, state, etc., in detail or in order to substitute for what was said earlier./
