이러하다 이러하다 [ireohada] /such; of this kind; of this sort — A state, shape, property, etc., being like this./
이럭저럭 이럭저럭 [ireogjeoreog] /somehow; one way or another — Haphazardly without a plan./before one knows — While one has not been aware of something./
이럭저럭하다 이럭저럭하다 [ireogjeoreoghada] /do somehow; manage somehow — To do something as it goes, without any fixed methods./
이런 이런 [ireon] /this; such; of this kind — A state, shape, nature, etc., being like this./oh no; darn it — An exclamation uttered when the speaker sees or hears about something surprising or sad./ireon — An abbreviated word for '이리한' (a conjugated form of '이리하다' (do in this way))./
이런고로 이런고로 [ireongoro] /therefore; so — On this account; for this reason; due to this./
이런대로 이런대로 [ireondaero] /passably; tolerably — Acceptably although not satisfactorily./
이런저런 이런저런 [ireonjeoreon] /this and that — Unclear and various kinds of./
이런즉 이런즉 [ireonjeug] /ireonjeuk — An abbreviated word for '이러한즉' (a conjugated form of '이러하다' (be like this))./
이럼 이럼 [ireom] /ireom — An abbreviated word for '이리하면' (a conjugated form of '이리하다' (do in this way))./ireom — An abbreviated word for '이러하면' (a conjugated form of '이러하다' (be like this))./
이렁저렁 이렁저렁 [ireongjeoreong] /somehow; one way or the other; by some means or other — Haphazardly without a definite method./before one knows — While one has not been aware of something./
이렁저렁하다 이렁저렁하다 [ireongjeoreonghada] /do somehow; do one way or another — To do something haphazardly without a definite method./
이렇게 이렇게 [ireohge] /ireoke — An abbreviated word for '이러하게' (a conjugated form of '이러하다' (be like this))./
