이레 이레 [ire] /seven days — Seven days./the seventh day — The seventh day of each month./
이력 이력 [iryeog] /career; record; background — One's personal history including one's academic career, jobs, experiences, etc./knack — Wisdom one has gotten while experiencing something a lot./
