이루다 이루다 [iruda] /form; make — To create a certain state or result./achieve; accomplish — To obtain a result that one has wanted./constitute; make up; comprise — To make several things gather to have a certain property or form a certain shape./achieve — To make a wedding, contract, etc., proceed./get sleep — To sleep./
이루어지다 이루어지다 [irueojida] /be done; be formed — For a certain state or result to be created or made./be achieved; be accomplished; be realized — To be done as one wants or plans./consist of; be made up of — For something to be made up of or consist of certain elements or parts./
이룩되다 이룩되다 [irugdoeda] /be achieved; be accomplished — For a great phenomenon, work, an aim, etc., to be realized./
이룩하다 이룩하다 [irughada] /achieve; accomplish; gain — To bring about a great phenomenon, finish work successfully, or realize an aim, etc./found; establish; set up — To build a country, society, etc./
이류 이류 [iryu] /second-rate; second-class — A status or class that is not as good as the first in a certain field./
이륙 이륙 [iryug] /takeoff; taking off — The process of an airplane, etc., ascending from the ground to fly./
이륙하다 이륙하다 [iryughada] /take off; depart — For an airplane, etc., to ascend from the ground to fly./
이륜차 이륜차 [iryuncha] /two-wheeler — A vehicle that has two wheels such as a bicycle, motorcycle, etc./
이르다 이르다 [ireuda] /arrive; reach — To get to a place./reach — To reach a certain time or period./reach; attain to — To reach a certain state or level./amount to; reach; come to — To total to a certain figure./extend — To extend over a certain range./tell; let someone know — To say something./tell — To say something for someone to keep in mind./tell; say — To let someone know something in advance./tell on — To tell someone about someone else's fault or mistake./call; refer to — To name or refer to an object or state./say; go — According to what an old proverb, book, etc. says./early; premature — Preceding or earlier than a point in time that serves as the baseline./
이른바 이른바 [ireunba] /as they say; so-called — As people call something./
