이무기 이무기 [imugi] /giant snake; huge serpent — A legendary big snake, which is said to have failed to become a dragon due to a curse and lives in water./
이문 이문 [imun] /margin; profit margin — The amount of money left as profit./
이물 이물 [imul] /unique object; odd thing — A peculiar and strange thing./foreign body; extraneous matter; impurity — A substance that is not pure or normal./tricky person — A person who has an insidious personality or thought, and thus whose true intentions are hard to determine./the deceased; the departed — A person who is dead and does not exist./
