쭉 쭉 [jjug] /straight — In the manner of drawing a line or marking a boundary straight./in a straight line — In the manner of things being arranged or placed evenly in one straight line./along a straight line — In the manner of tearing or stroking a bundle of paper or cloth at once./in one breath — In the manner of drinking water, etc., in one gulp./without stopping; on and on — In the manner of doing something at once without any hindrance./straight — In the manner of straightening one's body./suddenly; at once — In the manner of liquid or energy levels soaring or plummeting at once./all along — In the manner of doing something continuously during a certain period./sweepingly — In the manner of scanning a wide area at a glance./a lot — In the manner of losing much weight in a short time./(no equivalent expression) — In the state of having a sleek frame or shape./neatly and fashionably — In the manner of being well-dressed./
