찬양하다 찬양하다 [chanyanghada] /praise — To honor and compliment the beauty and greatness of something or someone./
찬장 찬장 [chanjang] /cupboard — A cabinet for storing food, plates, etc./
찬조 찬조 [chanjo] /support; sponsorship — An act of endorsing and helping someone or something./
찬조금 찬조금 [chanjogeum] /contribution; donation — A sum of money offered to help, endorsing something./
찬조하다 찬조하다 [chanjohada] /support; sponsor — To endorse and help someone or something./
찬찬하다 찬찬하다 [chanchanhada] /composed and orderly — One's personality, performance, behavior, etc., being very meticulous and composed./unhurried; leisurely — One's behavior or attitude being slightly slow without haste./
