찬탄 찬탄 [chantan] /admiration; praise — An expression of admiration and awe./
찬탄하다 찬탄하다 [chantanhada] /admire; praise — To admire and be in awe of./
찬탈 찬탈 [chantal] /usurpation; seizure — An act of forcefully taking away a throne, nation, power, etc./
찬탈하다 찬탈하다 [chantalhada] /usurp; seize — To forcefully take away a throne, nation, power, etc./
