찰- 찰- [chal-] /chal- — A prefix used to mean sticky./chal- — A prefix used to mean &quot;extremely fierce&quot; or &quot;very severe.&quot;/chal- — A prefix used to mean perfect-timed or faithful./chal- — A prefix used to mean &quot;of good quality.&quot;/
찰거머리 찰거머리 [chalgeomeori] /leech — A small blood-sucking worm that clings to its prey./leech — (figurative) A person who clings to another person and torments him/her./
