찰그랑찰그랑 찰그랑찰그랑 [chalgeurangchalgeurang] /with a clink; with a clank — A word used to describe the light clinking sounds made when small thin pieces of steel fall to the ground or strike against each other, or such a motion./
찰그랑찰그랑하다 찰그랑찰그랑하다 [chalgeurangchalgeuranghada] /clink; clank — For a light ringing sound to be made when small thin iron pieces, etc., fall down or clash with each other repeatedly, or to make this sound./
