찰나 찰나 [chalna] /instant — The very moment at which something happens./instant; moment — In Buddhism, a very short period of time./
찰떡 찰떡 [chaltteog] /chaltteok; sweet rice cakes — Tteok, rice cake, made from grains with glutinousness, such as glutinous rice./
찰떡궁합 찰떡궁합 [chaltteoggunghab] /perfect match — (figurative) Perfect chemistry between two people./best friends — (slang) A state in which two people think in similar ways and share a strong friendship./
