찰랑찰랑 찰랑찰랑 [chalrangchalrang] /brimfully — A word used to describe the sounds made when a liquid fills a container to the brim and begins to form small ripples and overflow, or such a motion./ripplingly — In the manner of hair, etc., moving softly like the waves on the shore./
