찰밥 찰밥 [chalbab] /chalbap; steamed glutinous rice — Cooked glutinous rice, a rice cooked with a mixture of glutinous rice, red beans, chestnuts, jujubes, black beans, etc./
찰벼 찰벼 [chalbyeo] /glutinous rice plant — A rice plant that produces glutinous grains./
