춘향가 춘향가 [chunhyangga] /Chunhyangga — One of the five episodes of pansori, Korean storytelling song; it revolves around a love story between Sung Chunhyang, the daughter of a gisaeng, a Korean female entertainer, and Yi Mongryong, a man of noble birth; it exhorts her fidelity to her lover while criticizing the tyranny of corrupt bureaucrats./
춘향전 춘향전 [chunhyangjeon] /Chunhyangjeon — The Story of Chunhyang, a novel from the Joseon Dynasty; the author and period are unknown; it revolves around a love story between Sung Chunhyang, the daughter of a gisaeng, a Korean female entertainer, and Yi Mongryong, a man of noble birth; it exhorts her fidelity to her lover while criticizing the tyranny of corrupt bureaucrats./
