출납부 출납부 [chulnabbu] /ledger; account book — A book that records the spending and earning of money or the sending and receiving of goods./
출납하다 출납하다 [chulnabhada] /receive and disburse; give and take — To send out or take in money or goods./
출당 출당 [chuldang] /expulsion from a political party — An act of removing one's name and taking away one's membership from a political party./
출동 출동 [chuldong] /going into action; being mobilized — An act of a particular group of people going outside, with a certain purpose./
