출마하다 출마하다 [chulmahada] /run for office; come forward as a candidate — To run in an election as a candidate./
출몰 출몰 [chulmol] /appearing and disappearing — The state of a certain phenomenon or object appearing and disappearing./
출몰하다 출몰하다 [chulmolhada] /appear and disappear — For a certain phenomenon or object to appear and disappear./
출발 출발 [chulbal] /departure; leaving — An act of leaving a place, heading for another place./start; beginning; kick-off — An act of starting to do something, or such a start./
출발되다 출발되다 [chulbaldoeda] /depart; leave — To leave a place, heading for another place./start — To start something./
출발선 출발선 [chulbalseon] /starting line — A line drawn in a race, etc., to indicate the point at which to start./starting line — A line at which someone starts something./
