출발역 출발역 [chulbalyeog] /departure station — The station from which one leaves for a destination on a train, etc./
출발점 출발점 [chulbaljeom] /starting point — A place at which someone starts./starting point — A point at which something starts./
출발지 출발지 [chulbalji] /point of departure — The place from which one leaves for a destination./
출발하다 출발하다 [chulbalhada] /depart; leave — To leave a place, heading for another place./start — To start something./
출범 출범 [chulbeom] /launch — An act of a ship leaving a port./start; beginning; being established — (figurative) The state of a new organization forming and starting operation./
출범되다 출범되다 [chulbeomdoeda] /be made to launch — For a ship to be made to leave a port./start; begin; be established — (figurative) For a new organization to be formed and be made to start operation./
출범시키다 출범시키다 [chulbeomsikida] /make something launch — To make a ship to leave a port./start; begin; establish — (figurative) To form a new organization and make it start operation./
