출산 출산 [chulsan] /childbirth; delivery; labor — To give birth to a child./
출산율 출산율 [chulsanyul] /birth rate; fertility rate — The ratio of births to the population./
출산하다 출산하다 [chulsanhada] /give birth; deliver — To give birth to a child./
