충무공 이순신 충무공 이순신 [chungmugong isunsin] /Chungmugong Yi Sunsin — Duke of Loyalty and Warfare Yi Sunsin: An admiral of the Joseon Dynasty (1545-1598); he made an enormous contribution to defeating the Japanese army during a series of Japanese invasions by inventing Geobukseon, the Turtle Ship, and wrote Nanjung-ilgi, a war diary which is an important record of the Japanese invasions./
