충분히 충분히 [chungbunhi] /enough; sufficiently; fully — In an ample quantity, without shortage./
충성 충성 [chungseong] /loyalty; allegiance; fidelity — A sincere and genuine heart, originating from one's true affection toward one's king or nation./
