탓하다 탓하다 [tashada] /lay blame on; find fault — To scold or resent someone, blaming him/her for one's situation, etc./
탕 탕 [tang] /tang — (honorific) Soup./thick soup — Thick soup served at a memorial service with many ingredients and little liquid./public bath — Facilities such as a hot spring, public bath, etc./bath tub — Equipment containing water within a public bath or bathroom./number of trips — A bound noun used to count the number of trips made to carry something or reach a certain place./number of doing something — A bound noun used to count the number of times something has been done./thump — A word imitating the sound made when a small piece of iron or a hard object hits something strongly./bang — A word imitating the sound made when a gun is fired./
탕감 탕감 [tanggam] /cut; reduction; curtailment; slashing — An act of cutting and lessening what one must pay, such as a debt, utility bill, tax, etc./
탕감되다 탕감되다 [tanggamdoeda] /(debt) forgiven; be written off — For the amount of a debt, utility bill, tax, etc., to be reduced./
