태양계 태양계 [taeyanggye] /solar system — The sun and its group of planets, including the Earth, that go around the sun./
태양력 태양력 [taeyangryeog] /solar calendar — A calendar that counts the days of the year based on the time it takes for Earth to revolve around the sun./
태양열 태양열 [taeyangyeol] /solar heat — The heat reaching the earth, coming from the sun./
