태연스레 태연스레 [taeyeonseure] /calmly; coolly; self-possessedly — In an attitude or complexion in which one shows no difference in a situation in which one is expected to hesitate or be scared./
태연자약 태연자약 [taeyeonjayag] /imperturbability; composure — The state of looking calm and not being shaken however one is stimulated emotionally./
태연자약하다 태연자약하다 [taeyeonjayaghada] /perfectly calm; cool and collected — Looking calm and not being shaken however one is stimulated emotionally./
