태평스럽다 태평스럽다 [taepyeongseureobda] /peaceful — Comfortable without any worries or troubles./
태평양 태평양 [taepyeongyang] /Pacific Ocean — The ocean surrounded by the continents of Asia, Oceania, South America, and North America; the largest ocean in the world, accounting for about one third of the surface of the earth./
태평하다 태평하다 [taepyeonghada] /peaceful — A nation being peaceful without worries or troubles./tranquil — One's mind being serene without worries or troubles./
