택배 택배 [taegbae] /parcel delivery service; home-delivery service — An act of delivering a mail, package, goods, etc., to a requested destination, in person./
택시 택시 [taegsi] /taxi; cab — A car that takes a passenger to a requested destination for money./
택일 택일 [taegil] /selecting one; choosing one — An act of picking one thing among many things./choice of an auspicious day; chosen date — An act of selecting a lucky day out of many possible days, as one arranges an important event; or such a day./
