턱없이 턱없이 [teogeobsi] /groundlessly; unfoundedly — Out of reason or without any grounds./absurdly; ridiculously — In an excessive degree for a certain level or situation./
턱턱 턱턱 [teogteog] /easily — A word describing one’s handling a task in a very brisk and mature manner./completely — A word describing one's sudden and repeated state of being short of breath, etc./spit-spit — A word imitating the sound made when one spits out repeatedly and strongly, or describing such a scene./with a thump — A word describing one's act of falling down or tumbling down repeatedly and heavily./abruptly — A word describing something suddenly and repeatedly stopping or being stuck in an object, or imitating such a sound./with a thump — A word imitating the sound made when something is repeatedly and strongly beaten or dusted, or describing such a scene./with a pop — A word imitating the sound made when a strong object suddenly bursts, or describing such a scene./in a snap — A word imitating the sound repeatedly made when an object is cut or snapped suddenly and helplessly, or describing such a scene./
