통렬히 통렬히 [tongryeolhi] /bitterly; bitingly — Very strongly and sharply./
통로 통로 [tongro] /path; route; passage — A way made for people to pass./channel — A method or means of communication, transaction, etc./
통마늘 통마늘 [tongmaneul] /head of garlic — Whole garlic, not being split into cloves./
통배추 통배추 [tongbaechu] /whole cabbage — The whole body of a cabbage, which has not been cut up or chopped./
