통용 통용 [tongyong] /general usage — The general public using something widely./interchangeable usage — The state of something being used interchangeably and widely in one field and in another field./
통용되다 통용되다 [tongyongdoeda] /be generally used — For something to be widely used by the general public./be passed; be used as a means — For a certain word or object to be used to indicate something or as a means for something./be interchangeably used — For something to be interchangeably and widely used in one field and in another field./
통용어 통용어 [tongyongeo] /language in current use — A word or language widely used by many people./
