통일감 통일감 [tongilgam] /sense of unity — A feeling that there are many different elements, which look just like one unit./
통일되다 통일되다 [tongildoeda] /be unified — For what has been divided or split to be combined into one./be concentrated — For many thoughts to be dumped and for one’s mind or heart to be made to focus on something./be standardized; be equalized — For different things to be made the same./
