통풍구 통풍구 [tongpunggu] /vent; air vent; ventilation ducts — A hole made to let air pass through./
통하다 통하다 [tonghada] /flow; pass; circulate — To flow well without any blockage./respond; make sense — For a speech or sentence to be logical and to be able to deliver a meaning well./run; conduct — For electricity to pass a certain point./be acceptable; be effective — For something to be accepted or become valid./be known as — For someone to be known to others as a certain being./be interrelated; be common — To be related with each other or to have something in common./lead to — To be connected to a certain place./be understood; be accepted — For one’s intention, thought, etc., to be delivered to someone or understood by someone./pass; go through — To pass a certain space by going through it./use — To use someone or something as a medium, when doing a certain thing./last — To span a certain period of time./be based on — To be based on a certain process or experience./form; make — To form a relationship./use — To use something in doing a certain thing./be communicated — To be communicated with each other using a certain language./
