파견하다 파견하다 [pagyeonhada] /send; dispatch — To send someone to a certain place with a mission or task./
파경 파경 [pagyeong] /broken mirror; end of marriage; divorce — (figurative) A state in which a married couple is separated due to their estranged relationship./
파계 파계 [pagye] /breaking the Buddhist precepts — An act of breaking the precepts of Buddhism, not complying with them./
파계승 파계승 [pagyeseung] /apostate monk — A monk who breaks the Buddhist precepts./
파계하다 파계하다 [pagyehada] /break the Buddhist precepts — To break the precepts of Buddhism, not complying with them./
파고 파고 [pago] /height of a wave — The height of a wave./wave height — (figurative) The level of tension in a certain relationship./
파고들다 파고들다 [pagodeulda] /burrow into — To enter something deeply./penetrate — To soak into something deeply./squeeze in — To squeeze into a very small space and secure a seat./study deeply — To study one field deeply./investigate; probe into — To try very hard to find out something./snuggle into — To be hugged to one's chest or in one's arms./
파괴 파괴 [pagoe] /destruction; devastation — An act of smashing or breaking something into pieces to bring it down./destruction; subversion; disruption — An act of disrupting order, a relationship, etc., or dismantling an organization to ruin it completely./
파괴되다 파괴되다 [pagoedoeda] /be destructed; be destroyed; be devastated — For something to be pulled down by being smashed or broken into pieces./be destructed; be destroyed; be subverted; be disrupted — For an order, a relationship, etc., to be ruined completely by being broken or dismantled./
파괴력 파괴력 [pagoeryeog] /destructive power — The power that destroys something./
파괴자 파괴자 [pagoeja] /destroyer; devastator; disrupter — A person who destroys something./
파괴적 파괴적 [pagoejeog] /being destructive; being devastating — A quality of smashing or breaking something into pieces to pull it down./being destructive; being subversive; being disruptive — A quality of breaking an order, a relationship, etc. or dismantling an organization to ruin it completely./destructive; devastating — Smashing or breaking something into pieces to pull it down./destructive; subversive; disruptive — Breaking an order, a relationship, etc. or dismantling an organization to ruin it completely./
파괴하다 파괴하다 [pagoehada] /destruct; destroy; devastate — To smash or break something into pieces to pull it down./destruct; destroy; subvert; disrupt — To break an order, a relationship, etc., or dismantle an organization to ruin it completely./
