퍼렇다 퍼렇다 [peoreohda] /deep blue — An opaque and dark blue./pale — One's face, lips, etc., being blue because one is cold or scared./sharp — A knife or the blade of a tool being very keen./furious; fiery — (figurative) One's spirit being overwhelmingly high and one's look being fierce./(no equivalent expression) — Fresh or vivid./
퍼레이드 퍼레이드 [peoreideu] /parade — The act of many people lining up and marching in the street, as a part of a festival or to celebrate something, or such a line of people./
