퍼먹다 퍼먹다 [peomeogda] /overeat — To eat too much food./
퍼붓다 퍼붓다 [peobusda] /pour — For rain or snow to fall a lot and violently./shine; shed — For sunlight, moonlight, or starlight to shine as if poured down./feel sleepy — For sleep or drowsiness to rush in./pour — To scoop and pour a lot of liquid such as water or soup, etc., fast./curse; lash out — To curse and criticize someone a lot./love — To pour one's affection and passion, etc./bombard; shoot — To fire guns, shells, arrows, etc., into one spot all at once./overdrink — To drink a very large amount of alcohol./
