퍼지다 퍼지다 [peojida] /spread out; flare out — For something to become thicker or wider at the bottom than it is at the top./get fat — A whole or part of one's body gaining weight and widening sideways./swell; be overcooked — For something boiled or steamed to be bloated./be tired — For one’s body to droop from being exhausted or tired./spread; reach out — For a certain substance or phenomenon to reach a wide range./increase; spread — For a number to increase a lot./
퍼지르다 퍼지르다 [peojireuda] /stretch — To stretch one's arms and legs freely and carelessly./speak in a foul manner — To speak recklessly or use foul language./eat a lot — To eat and drink a lot, without thinking./have babies — To give birth to children or excrete without thinking./
