허망하다 허망하다 [heomanghada] /unreliable; groundless — Looking false and unreliable./futile; vain — Being absurd and fruitless./
허무 허무 [heomu] /futility; emptiness — A state of thinking of something as worthless and meaningless, making one feel extremely empty and lonely./
허무감 허무감 [heomugam] /futility; emptiness — A state of finding something worthless and meaningless, feeling extremely empty and lonely./
허무맹랑하다 허무맹랑하다 [heomumaengranghada] /absurd; baseless; groundless; vain — Being unreasonably false, fruitless or without any substance./
허무적 허무적 [heomujeog] /being futile — A state of having a tendency to consider life or everyday affairs vain./futile — Showing a tendency to consider life or everyday affairs vain./
