허물어뜨리다 허물어뜨리다 [heomuleotteurida] /pull down; tear down; demolish — To make something piled up or built fall apart./bend; soften — To bend part of one's body or make one's attitude or facial expression soft./remove; get rid of; abolish — To make a given rule or custom in a society disappear./pull down; throw away; eliminate — To get rid of a given thought or belief./harm; hurt; destroy — To keep a person from staying healthy physically or mentally./bring down; destroy; harm — To lose one's property or social status, reputation, etc./break down; disturb; upset — To break the balance of power or disturb the steady state of something./
허물어지다 허물어지다 [heomuleojida] /be pulled down; be torn down; be demolished — For something piled up or built to fall apart./bend; be softened — For part of one's body to be bent or for one's attitude or facial expression to become soft./disappear; perish; break up; crumble — For a given rule or custom in a society to disappear./fall to pieces; crumble; disappear — For a given thought or belief to disappear psychologically./be harmed; be hurt; be destroyed — To be kept from staying healthy physically or mentally./be brought down; be destroyed; be harmed — For one's property or social status, reputation, etc., to disappear./break down; be disturbed; be upset — For the balance of power to be broken  or for the steady state of something to be disturbed./
허물어트리다 허물어트리다 [heomuleoteurida] /pull down; tear down; demolish — To make something piled up or built fall apart./bend; soften — To bend part of one's body or make one's attitude or facial expression soft./remove; get rid of; abolish — To make a given rule or custom in a society disappear./pull down; throw away; eliminate — To get rid of a given thought or belief./harm; hurt; destroy — To keep a person from staying healthy physically or mentally./bring down; destroy; harm — To lose one's property or social status, reputation, etc./break down; disturb; upset — To break the balance of power or disturb the steady state of something./
허물없다 허물없다 [heomuleobsda] /close; intimate; friendly — Being very close to each other with no need to worry about saving face or be cautious./
