허상 허상 [heosang] /illusion; delusion; false image — An object that seems to exist although it is not real, or an image that looks different than it actually is./virtual image — When light is reflected from a mirror or lens, an image forming in the opposite direction from where it is reflected./
허세 허세 [heose] /bluff; brag; ostentation — One's spirit that looks higher than it actually is, without substance./
허송세월 허송세월 [heosongsewol] /idling away; wasting time; killing time — An act of spending one's time uselessly, doing nothing./
