형세 형세 [hyeongse] /condition; circumstances; situation — The financial condition of one's life./situation; circumstances — A situation or state in which things are shaping up./vigor; force; spirit — Vigor or vitality that extends strongly./shape; geographical feature — A mountain's shape or geography in Korea's system of geomancy, or feng shui./
