홀딱 홀딱 [holttag] /completely; thoroughly — A word describing the state of having completely taken something off or being taken off./in an instant; in a flash — A word describing the motion of turning something over or being turned over a little quickly at once./powerfully; vigorously — A word describing the motion of running or jumping across something at once a little powerfully./at a gulp; at a mouthful — A word describing the motion of eating a small amount of food voraciously, completely at once./completely; deeply — A word describing the state of being extremely attracted by and lose one's heart to a person or thing, or being completely taken in by another without any doubt./completely; thoroughly — A word describing the state of losing all of what one has at once./deeply; completely — A word describing the state of being completely drenched, or covered with something./(no equivalent expression) — A word describing the state of staying up all night without any sleep./
