홀라당 홀라당 [holradang] /completely; thoroughly — A word describing the motion of being completely taken off or turned over to such an extent that the things inside are visible at once./completely; thoroughly — A word describing the state of one's small amount of money or wealth, etc., disappearing completely at once./
