훌쩍거리다 훌쩍거리다 [huljjeoggeorida] /slurp; gulp; guzzle — To drink up liquid, etc., repeatedly./sniffle; snivel — To inhale repeatedly through a runny nose./snivel; sniffle — To weep repeatedly while inhaling through a runny nose./
