훤하다 훤하다 [hwonhada] /bright; light — Being slightly, dimly bright./open; clear — A view being sweeping and unobstructed./clear; obvious — Something being transparent, obvious or quite predictable./fine-looking; attractive-looking — Having an extremely pleasing, neat, attractive appearance./familiar; knowledgeable — Having an accurate and deep knowledge about a certain task or object./
