휘 휘 [hwi] /swoosh; whoosh — A word imitating the sound of strong wind passing by./whew; phew — A word imitating the sound of letting out a deep breath all at once./whistle; whiz — A word imitating the sound of whistling./roughly — A word describing the motion of looking around roughly./
