흘러들다 흘러들다 [heulreodeulda] /flow into; stream into; find one's way into — For water, etc., to go or come into a certain place./flow into; enter — For goods, etc., to come into a certain place./flow into; infuse; penetrate — For an undesirable idea or lifestyle, etc., to infiltrate one's mind./flow into; drift  into; enter — To enter a certain place unknowingly after having wandered around./
