힘없다 힘없다 [himeobsda] /weak; feeble; faint — Lacking energy or desire to do something./powerless; helpless — Lacking power or authority, etc./
힘없이 힘없이 [himeobsi] /weakly; feebly — In the state of lacking the energy or desire to do something./powerlessly; helplessly — In a state of lacking power or authority, etc./
힘입다 힘입다 [himibda] /be supported; be backed; be indebted — To receive help from another./be encouraged; be heartened — To gain courage or strength from another's act or words./be influenced; be inspired; be motivated — To be influenced by something./
힘자랑 힘자랑 [himjarang] /flexing one's muscles; boast of one's strength — An act of showing one's strength/
힘주다 힘주다 [himjuda] /strain; exert; strengthen — To focus one's power or energy on a single thing./speak emphatically — To speak with an emphasis./
힘줄 힘줄 [himjul] /tendon; sinew — A cord of tough, white tissue, which comprises a muscle./
힘차다 힘차다 [himchada] /strong; powerful; vigorous — Lively and energetic./
힙합 힙합 [hibhab] /hiphop — A new style of music or dance which emerged among young African-American people during the 1980's./
힝 힝 [hing] /honk — A word imitating the sound of blowing one's nose hard or letting out breath through the nose./
